  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic**: **(2nd number)² ****× 2 = 1st number**.\n\nNow,\n\nOption - (1) : 128 : 8\n\n→ (8)² × 2\n\n→ 64 × 2 = 128.\n\n \n\nOption - (2) : 288 : 12\n\n→ (12)2 × 2\n\n→ 144 × 2 = 288.\n\n \n\n**Option - (3) : 350 : 15**\n\n**→ (15)2 × 2**\n\n**→ 225 × 2 = 450 ≠ 350.**\n\n \n\nOption - (4) : 18 : 3\n\n→ (3)2 × 2\n\n→ 9 × 2 = 18.\n\n \n\nHence, \"Option - (3)\" is the correct answer.",
